      "zh": {
        "title": "美國航空 JFK－西雅圖機場（SEA）市佔從 14.6% 跌至 0.6% 將以 A321neo 重啟每日兩班",
        "summary": "市佔驟降；美國航空擬 2027 年 4 月以 A321neo 每日兩班重啟紐約甘迺迪機場（JFK）－西雅圖機場（SEA）航線",
        "body": [
          "據 Simple Flying 報導，美國航空在紐約甘迺迪機場（JFK）至西雅圖機場（SEA）航線的市場佔有率已從 14.6% 下滑至 0.6%。",
          "報導指出，該航司計劃於 2027 年 4 月以空中巴士 A321neo 機型重新開辦此航線，並安排每日兩班往返。",
          "此舉標誌著美國航空在經歷市場份額大幅縮減後，嘗試以新型單走道機型恢復跨國幹線運力。",
          "目前具體班表與配置細節尚未對外發布，僅以官方規劃為準。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "American Airlines’ JFK–Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (SEA) market share drops from 14.6% to 0.6%; A321neo return planned",
        "summary": "Market share plunges; American plans two daily A321neo round trips between JFK and Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (SEA) from April 2027.",
        "body": [
          "Simple Flying reports that American Airlines' share of the New York JFK (JFK)–Seattle-Tacoma International Airport (SEA) market has fallen from 14.6% to 0.6%.",
          "The carrier intends to relaunch the route in April 2027 using Airbus A321neo aircraft, operating two daily round‑trips.",
          "The move marks an attempt to rebuild trans‑continental capacity after a sharp loss of market share.",
          "Exact schedules and aircraft configurations have not yet been disclosed and remain subject to the airline's official plan."
        ]
